'''Dropped the ball''' is an [[Combat Achievements/Elite|elite combat achievement]] which requires the player to defeat [[Akkha]] without dropping any materialising orbs and without dying, at raid level 150 or above.

==Strategy==
This refers to your character spawning the orbs from Akkha's special attack, not the white orbs on the final phase. Stand still during the shadow special to complete the task.

